<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia treasury raises 58.5 mln dinars at auction.</title>
<headline>Tunisia treasury raises 58.5 mln dinars at auction.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunisian Treasury on Tuesday raised 58.5 million dinars at its weekly auction of treasury bills dated July 1, and repaid maturing paper totalling 38.6 million dinars.</p>
<p>Herewith breakdown of the results:</p>
<p>  Maturity			 Amount	Rate	 Previous</p>
<p>rate - Two-year notes payable</p>
<p>in equal annual tranches</p>
<p>					 10 MD	6.9375	    6.9375</p>
<p>					47.5 MD     7.0000	    7.0000</p>
<p>- Two-year note payable at maturity</p>
<p>					 1 MD	 7.0000	    7.0000</p>
<p>Banks bid for 163 million dinars for two-year paper at between 6.9375 and 7.3125 percent.</p>
<p>(one $=1.1085 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
